<title>JAPAN: CITIC Hong Kong launches 2.8% samurai bonds - Daiwa.</title>
<headline>CITIC Hong Kong launches 2.8% samurai bonds - Daiwa.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following samurai issue was announced by lead manager Daiwa Securities on Thursday.</p>
<p> BORROWER China International Trust and Investment Corp Hong</p>
<p>	    Kong (Holdings) Ltd (CITIC)</p>
<p> AMT	20 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON   2.8 pct</p>
<p> MATURITY 27 March 2003</p>
<p> TYPE		samurai</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 par</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  27 Dec 1996</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	Dec 19 to Dec 25</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     JBRI A+</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Daiwa Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    N/A</p>
</text>
